# Local test harness. Compiles the real Lyrion Server sources (parser/transport/
# registry/FSM) into a console app and drives them against a live LMS server.
# Deliberately untracked: it hardcodes a personal server IP and player MAC, and
# it carries copies of ServerDriver logic that would drift from the real thing.
# Sanitize both before ever committing it.
tmp_harness/
